msgstr "I bedi ú-gwanna i cenedh filename|sha1 (anírad: filename|40 ledh hexadecimal). Tiro i MISP nî pelia erin SHA1 ne PEhash, ned anír hash bain, ceria ped github ne https://github.com/MISP/MISP!"

